{"id":"94e1d47d7b40b77a","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-projective-sections.md","title":"Countable Families of Projective Sections","display":"thm-projective-sections — Countable Families of Projective Sections","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-projective-sections","aliases":["68-thm-projective-sections"],"display":"thm-projective-sections — Countable Families of Projective Sections","depends_on":["[[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]","[[68-thm-projective-enumeration]]","[[68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"20.2 p.76 / PDF 85","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-proof-read-and-correspondence-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-projective-sections"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-projective-sections</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-projective-sections — Countable Families of Projective Sections"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"150b567749c83f49\" href=\"?note=150b567749c83f49\" title=\"68-df-projective-hierarchy\">68-df-projective-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc4e938a01248a42\" href=\"?note=cc4e938a01248a42\" title=\"68-thm-projective-enumeration\">68-thm-projective-enumeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ebe52081fac785e\" href=\"?note=0ebe52081fac785e\" title=\"68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure\">68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"20.2 p.76 / PDF 85"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-read-and-correspondence-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在 ZFC 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(X_{m,k})\">\\(F:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(X_{m,k})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq X_{m,k+1}\">\\(P\\subseteq X_{m,k+1}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\in P\\leftrightarrow(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in F(y))\">\\(\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\in P\\leftrightarrow(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in F(y))\\)</span>。粗体类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"150b567749c83f49\" href=\"?note=150b567749c83f49\" title=\"68-df-projective-hierarchy\">68-df-projective-hierarchy</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F(y)\\in\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\in\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F(y)\\in\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F(y)\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F(y)\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\boldsymbol\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F(y)\\in\\boldsymbol\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\in\\boldsymbol\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F(y)\\in\\boldsymbol\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 20.2 的关键是允许任意实参数。正向固定自然数 y；反向用 20.1 的同一个通用关系选取各切片参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_y\">\\(\\beta_y\\)</span>，再以一个实数编码整个序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\beta_y)_{y\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\beta_y)_{y\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。用该实参数及递归投影得到联合关系。此处显式采用 ZFC，涵盖选择这一可数参数序列所需的选择原则。无参数/lightface 类没有这个无一致性假设的结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-projective-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"150b567749c83f49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-projective-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"cc4e938a01248a42","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-projective-enumeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure","status":"resolved","id":"0ebe52081fac785e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-projective-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"150b567749c83f49","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 ZFC 中，$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$F:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(X_{m,k})$。$P\\subseteq X_{m,k+1}$ 满足 $\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\in P\\leftrightarrow(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in F(y))$。粗体类见 [[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(X_{m,k})","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq X_{m,k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\in P\\leftrightarrow(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in F(y))","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F(y)\\in\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}).","display":true},{"tex":"P\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F(y)\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}).","display":true},{"tex":"P\\in\\boldsymbol\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F(y)\\in\\boldsymbol\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta_y","display":false},{"tex":"(\\beta_y)_{y\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false}],"bytes":1914,"backlinks":[{"id":"c0d1050ea9a023f8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\boldsymbol\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X_{m,k})$ 沿用 [[68-thm-projective-sections]]；$\\operatorname{SigmaRing}$ 见 [[68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations]]。"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-projective-sections]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-projective-sections|thm-projective-sections — Countable Families of Projective Sections]]"}],"outgoing":["150b567749c83f49","cc4e938a01248a42","0ebe52081fac785e"]}